cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the stored results, please cite it using the metadata below. Every DFT value it
  is built on comes from the oxygen-vacancy database of Kumagai et al. (Phys. Rev. Materials 5, 123803, 2021);
  please cite that article as well (see README.md).
type: software
title: >-
  oxide-vacancy-descriptors: re-derivation of oxygen-vacancy formation-energy results with structure-only and
  descriptor-augmented graph networks
